00:01:28.010 --> 00:01:30.000
Angela: Just took a little bit
of work

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.030
and a whole lot of love.

00:01:32.030 --> 00:01:33.030
Muah.

00:01:35.150 --> 00:01:38.060
Are you ready to do this?
All right.

00:01:38.060 --> 00:01:40.190
