00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:38.110
See?
Now wasn't that easy?

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:40.110
All it takes
is some confidence

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:42.110
and a willingness
to get started.

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:44.170
And even though
I'm not there,

00:03:44.170 --> 00:03:47.110
I'll guide you
through this.

00:03:47.110 --> 00:03:49.200
I want to thank
my very special assistant,

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:54.200
my daughter Zuri, for helping me
with today's vlog like always.

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:58.010
And remember, the road
ahead might look rough,

00:03:58.010 --> 00:04:00.120
but you can make the journey
with a little bit of work

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:02.160
and a whole lot of love.

00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:03.160
Muah.

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:16.120
Are you ready to do this?

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:18.100
All right.
Here we go.

00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:21.170
First you want to moisturize
these beautiful thick curls

00:04:21.170 --> 00:04:25.110
with a leave-in conditioner, which
will also help detangle the kinks.

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:29.200
Now, part all your hair
into sections and clip it away.

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:37.230
You're doing an amazing job.

00:04:43.060 --> 00:04:44.220
Yay!
You did it!

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:46.150
That was so much fun.

00:04:48.060 --> 00:04:50.050
I knew you could do it.
